      "scope": "Complete standalone scalar initialization with original source-backed data, actual software-built return frame and installed RTI p-code",
      "limitations": [
        "VERSION words, incoming registers, fresh stack and opaque storage are explicit synthetic software inputs, not observed processor state.",
        "The ordinary supplied LR is an external return address. Original instructions produce both frame words consumed by RTI; no exception frame or control result is supplied.",
        "The primary route reads and writes the actual original ELF vector word through a source-bound observation plan. No caller vector bytes, guard overlays or already-tagged initial variant are supplied.",
